<h1>Club Bookkeeping &amp; Finance</h1>

<p class="lead">Club bookkeeping software that keeps dues, donations, receipts, and payment processing right next to the roster — so you’re not hunting through three spreadsheets when someone asks where the money went.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-directory.png" alt="Finance ledger screenshot with tagged transactions, receipt uploads, and payment records" width="826" height="826" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="overview" class="card" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="overview-heading">Books where the work happens</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Finances live alongside members and events, not in a separate accounting tool you open once a quarter. Tag transactions for budget tracking, upload receipts and invoices to keep everything organized, and accept online payments when you’re ready — all tied to real people in the roster so you can see who paid, who’s owed, and what it was for.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">GatherPack uses <a href="https://stripe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe</a> for credit cards, bank transfer, and dozens of other methods. Zeffy, PayPal, and Venmo are tracked on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a> for groups that need them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

