<section id="integration" class="card" aria-labelledby="integration-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="integration-heading">Tied to people, not just numbers</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Because finance hangs off the <a href="/features/members/">member roster</a>, a dues payment is linked to a person, a team, and a season — useful when a <a href="/use-cases/sports-leagues/">sports league</a> needs per-family balances or a <a href="/use-cases/nonprofits/">nonprofit</a> needs donation histories by donor.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Sibling pillars: <a href="/features/members/">Members</a> · <a href="/features/events/">Events</a> · <a href="/features/communication/">Communication</a> — announcements can surface dues reminders; <a href="/features/automation/">custom reports</a> can summarize giving or budget health.</p>
