<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Finance FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can we accept dues and donations online?</h3>
    <p>Yes — Stripe handles cards and bank transfers today. If you need Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo, that’s next on the roadmap with dates at <a href="/roadmap/">/roadmap</a>.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Do I need managed hosting for payments?</h3>
    <p>No. Self-hosters can configure Stripe themselves. Managed hosting just means Sledgehammer sets it up and keeps it updated for you.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can I track budgets with tags?</h3>
    <p>Yes — tag each transaction (e.g., “build season — parts” or “fundraiser — bake sale”) and filter the ledger for quick budget views before turning to <a href="/features/automation/">custom reports</a>.</p>
